{"id": "EUVD-2026-103566", "enisaUuid": "e7e53911-c795-3919-9379-7dba459d9ace", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nKVM: s390: Add missing srcu in kvm_s390_set_irq_state()\n\nLike kvm_s390_inject_vcpu(), kvm_s390_set_irq_state() also needs the\nkvm->srcu or the slots lock when performing the Store status operation.\n\nFix by taking kvm->srcu in kvm_s390_set_irq_state().", "datePublished": "2026-10-18T15:20:23", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T09:23:21", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7a33007b95c8908ae3980eb2b4c508f8936766df", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f3a557067d57ce6ae98d485c8009b223e16f5f36"], "aliases": ["GHSA-q542-rw7h-r852", "CVE-2026-98652"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.16, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0bf959fb-20d7-3d0d-be66-0338e46f47a6", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "ba5c1e9b6ceebdc39343cc03eb39f077abd3c571 <f3a557067d57ce6ae98d485c8009b223e16f5f36"}, {"id": "515ce575-2394-33f2-85d4-cc2a9813d37b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "56535423-c975-3f3f-8397-1d056adf4d64", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.9"}, {"id": "5bf5aefe-fb83-3a9d-943d-5b2ebb2dd496", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "2.6.26"}, {"id": "7918b91c-ce52-3fc1-9c7a-751f27e9900c", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "ba5c1e9b6ceebdc39343cc03eb39f077abd3c571 <7a33007b95c8908ae3980eb2b4c508f8936766df"}, {"id": "aa353aa5-3f33-3517-881e-a334b317c169", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "55445434-9ca3-38c2-b2fa-aa1bb577a324", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}